```js
AISYS.defineGame({
  schema: 1, kit: "endless-runner",
  id: "bloodstream-dash", title: "Bloodstream Dash", seed: "bloodstream-01",
  theme: { preset: "retro-pixel" },

  player: { x: 220, w: 44, h: 56, gravity: 2400, jumpVelocity: 900, lives: 3, invulnerableSec: 1.2 },
  world:  { groundY: 600, speed: 360, maxSpeed: 720, accel: 6 },

  spawner: {
    interval: [0.9, 1.5],
    table: [
      { type: "hazard", id: "kolesterol", w: 44, h: 48, weight: 3 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "plak-lemak", w: 90, h: 24, weight: 2 },
      { type: "hazard", id: "sel-menyempit", w: 40, h: 70, weight: 2 },
      { type: "item", weight: 5, heights: ["ground", "mid", "high"] }
    ]
  },

  rules: {
    perSecond: 5,
    correct: { score: 50, sfx: "coin" },
    wrong:   { score: -20, sfx: "hit", showExplain: true },
    hazard:  { lives: -1, sfx: "hit", shake: 8 },
    combo:   { step: 5, max: 4 },
    difficulty: { everySec: 15, speed: 25 }
  }
});
// END_OF_MANIFEST
```

**Bloodstream Dash** adalah game arcade Endless Runner bertema petualangan di aliran darah dengan gaya Retro Pixel, di mana pemain melompati rintangan kolesterol, plak lemak, dan sel menyempit sambil mengumpulkan koin skor. Asumsi penting: karena mode arcade murni, item berfungsi sebagai koin skor generik tanpa konten belajar.
